{
  "version": "0.5.10",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-22T06:28:00+03:00",
  "notes": [
    "Hotfix for v0.5.9 updater rollback: the HTTP health endpoint now comes up before extended history migration and initial 7-day history loading.",
    "Extended v0.5.9 history migration runs after a 5-second startup grace period, preventing the old v0.5.8 updater's short health window from rolling back a healthy but slow migration.",
    "Adds boot.log diagnostics for pre-server startup stages and fatal initialization errors.",
    "Future updater runs allow up to 120 seconds for health checks and capture startup stdout/stderr in logs/update-startup.log.",
    "Includes all v0.5.9 history, sync, logging, graceful-shutdown, retry and database-handoff improvements."
